# AEP Referee APP

Stack: Next.js 15 App Router, TypeScript, Supabase (service role server-side), Vitest, Tailwind, PDF/XLSX import.

| User intent | Skill / code |
|-------------|--------------|
| Excel judges / calendar PDF | repo parsers + `senior-backend`; data quality → `data-quality-auditor` |
| Supabase RLS / auth | `senior-backend` + Supabase MCP |
| Zones / macro regions | `src/lib/aep-zones.ts` |
| Competition dedupe | `src/lib/competition-dedup.ts` |
| Referee sanctions | `src/lib/sanctions.ts`, `src/server/services/referee-sanctions.ts` |
| Judges registry | `src/lib/judges-registry/`, `POST /api/v1/referees/import?apply=` |
| Import/export UI | `src/lib/import-export-ui.ts`, `src/components/data-transfer/` |
| Roster UX / guards | `src/lib/roster-ui.ts`, `roster-route-guards.ts`, `roster-active.ts` |

Verify after changes: `npm test` then `npm run build`.
